<view class="test-page">
  <view class="test-heading">
    <image src="/assets/brand/logo-ai.png" mode="aspectFit" aria-label="五色知时"/>
    <view class="heading-label">测一测</view>
  </view>

  <view class="test-hero">
    <view class="hero-kicker">ZI WEI DOU SHU</view>
    <view class="hero-title">紫微斗数</view>
    <view class="hero-subtitle">起盘与合盘</view>
    <view class="hero-copy">以出生资料建立命盘结构，从传统术数视角观察阶段运势与关系节奏。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="chart-section">
    <view class="section-title">选择测算方式</view>
    <view class="section-copy">先完善准确资料，再进入相应测算。</view>

    <button class="chart-card natal" bindtap="toProfile">
      <view class="chart-number">01</view>
      <view class="chart-copy">
        <view class="chart-kicker">PERSONAL CHART</view>
        <view class="chart-title">紫微起盘</view>
        <text>建立个人命盘，查看阶段运势、十二宫位与重要时间节点。</text>
        <view class="chart-action">准备起盘资料　›</view>
      </view>
      <view class="chart-orbit"><view/><view/><text>命</text></view>
    </button>

    <button class="chart-card match" bindtap="toMatchProfile">
      <view class="chart-number">02</view>
      <view class="chart-copy">
        <view class="chart-kicker">CHART COMPARISON</view>
        <view class="chart-title">紫微合盘</view>
        <text>对照两份命盘，观察关系互动、相处节奏与阶段性影响。</text>
        <view class="chart-action">准备合盘资料　›</view>
      </view>
      <view class="chart-orbit double"><view/><view/><text>合</text></view>
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="method-note">
    <view class="note-mark">序</view>
    <view><view>资料与测算说明</view><text>出生日期为基础资料，准确时辰可提高命盘完整度。测算内容用于传统文化研究与生活参考，不替代医疗、法律、投资或其他专业判断。</text></view>
  </view>
</view>
